4	//!
5	//! Phase 2 ships the dispatch surface and one working handler (`SYS_GETINFO`).
6	//! Every other Phase-2 `SYS_*` lands here as an `ENOSYS` stub so that
7	//! `kernel_call_dispatch` can match on every reachable `m_type` and the
8	//! `k_call_mask` permission check has somewhere to land. Each stub keeps
